  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "It's a great feature to allow naming a instance. It can be used to express the intention of the instance, such as celebrating someone's birthday.\n\nHowever, I don't think it's good idea to name instance \"<display name>'s instance\" by default /initially because it's common to leave instance open when I leave the instance for people in the instance.\n\nThis is especially for Public instances but also for Friends plus instances.\n\nTherefore I think the name of instance should be random by default / initially.",
